## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo throttle by CKNE health (high level, not production-ready)
function throttleByCKNE(tenantId, ckne) {
  const bucket = getTenantBucket(tenantId);
  if (ckne.health < 0.5) bucket.reduce(ckne.sampling);
  // return true to emit, false to drop
  return Math.random() < bucket.sampling;
}
```

